{"verse_key": "13:40", "surah": 13, "verse": 40, "text_uthmani": "وَإِن مَّا نُرِيَنَّكَ بَعْضَ ٱلَّذِى نَعِدُهُمْ أَوْ نَتَوَفَّيَنَّكَ فَإِنَّمَا عَلَيْكَ ٱلْبَلَـٰغُ وَعَلَيْنَا ٱلْحِسَابُ", "translation": "And whether We show you part of what We promise them or take you in death, upon you is only the [duty of] notification, and upon Us is the account.", "verse_from_ms": 999040, "verse_to_ms": 1014870, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/13.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "وَإِن", "start_ms": 999040, "end_ms": 999880}, {"i": 1, "text": "مَّا", "start_ms": 999880, "end_ms": 1000720}, {"i": 2, "text": "نُرِيَنَّكَ", "start_ms": 1000720, "end_ms": 1002320}, {"i": 3, "text": "بَعْضَ", "start_ms": 1002320, "end_ms": 1002850}, {"i": 4, "text": "ٱلَّذِى", "start_ms": 1002850, "end_ms": 1003630}, {"i": 5, "text": "نَعِدُهُمْ", "start_ms": 1003630, "end_ms": 1004630}, {"i": 6, "text": "أَوْ", "start_ms": 1004630, "end_ms": 1004890}, {"i": 7, "text": "نَتَوَفَّيَنَّكَ", "start_ms": 1004890, "end_ms": 1007390}, {"i": 8, "text": "فَإِنَّمَا", "start_ms": 1007390, "end_ms": 1009100}, {"i": 9, "text": "عَلَيْكَ", "start_ms": 1009100, "end_ms": 1009900}, {"i": 10, "text": "ٱلْبَلَـٰغُ", "start_ms": 1009900, "end_ms": 1011030}, {"i": 11, "text": "وَعَلَيْنَا", "start_ms": 1011030, "end_ms": 1011880}, {"i": 12, "text": "ٱلْحِسَابُ", "start_ms": 1011880, "end_ms": 1014815}]}